WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.403 --> 00:00:06.372
- GOOD MORNING.

00:00:06.472 --> 00:00:10.877
CLIVE "DOUBLE DOWN" RUGGINS,
I'M DANIEL TATE.

00:00:10.977 --> 00:00:15.381
I AM YOUR PAROLE OFFICER,
AND I JUST WANT TO HELP YOU.

00:00:15.481 --> 00:00:17.449
- HOW THE HELL YOU SUPPOSED
TO HELP ME, MAN?

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.085
WHAT THE [bleep] YOU
KNOW ABOUT THE STREETS,

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:22.188
WHAT WITH YOUR DIPLOMAS
ON THE WALL?

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:23.556
- SETTLE DOWN.

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:27.994
I KNOW THAT YOU MIGHT NOT
BE ABLE TO RELATE TO ME,

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:32.031
BUT I THINK I KNOW SOMEBODY

00:00:32.131 --> 00:00:35.534
WHO YOU CAN RELATE TO.

00:00:35.634 --> 00:00:36.635
LITTLE HOMIE.

00:00:36.736 --> 00:00:37.937
- WHAT UP?

00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:41.407
WHAT UP?
IT'S MY FAVORITE CLIVE.

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:44.443
[laughs] WHAT UP, DUDE?
- NAH, DOG, LISTEN.

00:00:44.543 --> 00:00:46.779
HEY, MAN, I AIN'T TRYING
TO TALK TO NO PUPPET, MAN.

00:00:46.879 --> 00:00:48.448
- IT'S NOT A PUPPET.

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:49.815
IT'S LITTLE HOMIE,

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:52.485
AND I WOULD LIKE
FOR YOU TO TALK TO HIM, CLIVE.

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:55.755
SEE, I USED TO WORK IN
THE JUVENILE CORRECTION SYSTEMS,

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:59.058
AND I FOUND
THIS METHOD VERY EFFECTIVE.

00:00:59.158 --> 00:01:01.260
- I AIN'T NO JUVENILE,
MAN, OKAY?

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:02.595
- HE'S RIGHT.

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:04.596
DOES HE LOOK LIKE A KID
TO YOU?

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:06.799
COME ON!
HE'S A GROWN-ASS MAN.

00:01:06.899 --> 00:01:08.901
- SEE? WHAT?

00:01:09.001 --> 00:01:12.105
- LOOK, IT'S VERY IMPORTANT

00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:16.509
FOR YOUR PAROLE
THAT YOU TALK TO LITTLE HOMIE.

00:01:18.677 --> 00:01:19.778
- WHAT'S UP, LITTLE HOMIE?

00:01:19.878 --> 00:01:23.983
- [laughs]
THAT'S BETTER, MY NEGRUMPS.

00:01:24.084 --> 00:01:26.452
HEH, WHAT YOU GETTING
INTO THESE DAYS, MAN?

00:01:26.552 --> 00:01:27.687
WHAT IT IS? WHAT IT IS?

00:01:27.787 --> 00:01:30.623
YOU GOT A JOB YET?

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:34.093
- [sighs] I'M TRYING, MAN,
BUT NO ONE WILL HIRE ME.

00:01:34.193 --> 00:01:38.898
- YEAH, HEY,
[bleep] ALL THAT NOISE, MAN.

00:01:38.998 --> 00:01:40.900
BETWEEN YOU AND ME, MAN,

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.903
AIN'T NOBODY TRYING
TO HIRE A [bleep] WITH A RECORD.

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:46.505
BUT HEY, MAN,
WHAT YOU NEED TO BE DOING

00:01:46.605 --> 00:01:50.977
IS GET BACK INTO SOME CRIMES,
MANG.

00:01:51.077 --> 00:01:53.412
- [stammers]
WHAT'S GOING ON, MAN?

00:01:53.512 --> 00:01:55.782
- ARE YOU TALKING TO ME?
- YEAH.

00:01:55.882 --> 00:01:58.351
- WELL, YOU SHOULD BE TALKING
TO LITTLE HOMIE RIGHT NOW.

00:01:58.451 --> 00:02:00.186
- WHAT IS GOING ON?
- YEAH, BITCH!

00:02:00.286 --> 00:02:01.320
TALK TO ME!

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:02.721
LOOK AT ME
WHEN I'M TALKING TO YOU!

00:02:02.821 --> 00:02:04.257
- OKAY, OKAY, FINE.

00:02:04.357 --> 00:02:07.193
- [panting]

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:09.628
DAMN!

00:02:09.728 --> 00:02:11.997
SO, YOU SMOKING WEED, [bleep]?

00:02:12.097 --> 00:02:13.732
- NO, MAN.
NO, NO, LITTLE HOMIE.

00:02:13.832 --> 00:02:15.768
I'M DONE WITH DRUGS.

00:02:15.869 --> 00:02:17.403
- [laughs]

00:02:17.503 --> 00:02:19.772
[bleep].
I GOT SOMETHING.

00:02:19.872 --> 00:02:22.308
UH-OH, UH-OH, UH-OH.

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:26.045
LOOK AT THIS HERE, NEGRUMPS.

00:02:26.145 --> 00:02:28.481
SMOKE THIS WEED!

00:02:28.581 --> 00:02:29.548
- NO, NO, NO, NO, NO, NO, MAN.

00:02:29.648 --> 00:02:30.950
I'M DONE, MAN.
YOU HEAR ME?

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:32.051
I'M DONE WITH DRUGS.

00:02:32.151 --> 00:02:33.586
I AIN'T DOING ALL THAT.

00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:35.554
- I DON'T KNOW.

00:02:35.654 --> 00:02:38.190
LITTLE HOMIE
SEEMS PRETTY SERIOUS ABOUT THAT.

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:39.959
- HERE.

00:02:40.059 --> 00:02:41.326
- WHAT?
LOOK, I'M CONFUSED, MAN.

00:02:41.427 --> 00:02:42.661
WHAT DO YOU WANT ME TO DO HERE?

00:02:42.761 --> 00:02:44.163
- WELL,
I WANT YOU TO CLEAN UP YOUR ACT,

00:02:44.263 --> 00:02:46.498
BUT YOU'RE NOT TALKING
TO ME RIGHT NOW.

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:48.935
YOU'RE TALKING TO LITTLE HOMIE.

00:02:49.035 --> 00:02:50.904
- NOW SMOKE THAT [bleep]

00:02:51.004 --> 00:02:54.773
OR I'LL SMOKE THIS BITCH
RIGHT HERE.

00:02:54.873 --> 00:02:58.378
- OH, MY GOD.

00:02:58.478 --> 00:03:00.379
HE'S NOT MESSING AROUND.

00:03:00.479 --> 00:03:02.481
I THINK YOU BETTER
DO WHAT HE SAYS.

00:03:02.581 --> 00:03:04.284
- OKAY, ALL RIGHT.
LITTLE HOMIE, MAN.

00:03:04.384 --> 00:03:05.918
JUST RELAX, MAN.
RELAX, LITTLE HOMIE.

00:03:06.019 --> 00:03:08.688
TAKE IT EASY. I'M JUST--
I'M GONNA SMOKE IT DOWN.

00:03:12.858 --> 00:03:15.094
WAIT, WAIT,
NO, NO, NO, NO, NO, NO,

00:03:15.194 --> 00:03:17.162
NO, YOU CAN'T FOOL ME.

00:03:17.263 --> 00:03:19.465
YOU'RE TRYING TO TRICK ME, MAN.

00:03:19.565 --> 00:03:20.766
NO, I'M DONE WITH THE WEED.

00:03:20.866 --> 00:03:22.601
[gunshot]

00:03:22.701 --> 00:03:24.203
OH!

00:03:24.303 --> 00:03:27.240
- [chuckles]

00:03:27.340 --> 00:03:29.609
CATCH, [bleep].

00:03:29.709 --> 00:03:35.248
[laughs]

00:03:35.348 --> 00:03:36.382
DUMBASS!

00:03:36.482 --> 00:03:38.550
NOW YOUR FINGERPRINTS
IS ON THE WEAPON!

00:03:38.651 --> 00:03:42.121
YOU IN THIS WITH ME NOW, RIGHT?

00:03:42.221 --> 00:03:43.523
- OKAY, LITTLE HOMIE, YEAH.

00:03:43.623 --> 00:03:47.159
- HMM.

00:03:47.259 --> 00:03:49.028
- OH! OH!

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:59.806
- YOU FAILED THE TEST.

00:03:59.906 --> 00:04:05.344
I HAVE NO CHOICE
BUT TO REVOKE YOUR PAROLE.

00:04:05.444 --> 00:04:07.913
- WHAT?
OH, MAN.

00:04:08.013 --> 00:04:09.615
AIN'T THIS ABOUT A BITCH?

00:04:09.715 --> 00:04:11.551
- ON YOUR FEET, BABY BOY.

00:04:11.651 --> 00:04:12.618
- GET HIM OUT OF HERE.

00:04:12.719 --> 00:04:14.987
- COME ON.

00:04:15.087 --> 00:04:18.190
- I CAN'T BELIEVE THAT NEGRUMPS
ACTUALLY THOUGHT I KILLED YOU.

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:19.356
- I KNOW, RIGHT?

